<title>CANADA: PanCanadian proposes stock split.</title>
<headline>PanCanadian proposes stock split.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>PanCanadian Petroleum Ltd said on Thursday that its board approved a two-for-one split of the company's shares.</p>
<p>The split still required the approval of the PanCanadian's shareholders, which were slated to vote on the proposal at the company's annual meeting in April.</p>
<p>If the stock split was approved, the record date would be May 8, 1997, PanCanadian said.</p>
